      55.17,
      401.34,
      295.22,
      454.5
    ],
    "text": "I, John Anthony Emmanuel Amarathunga , Minister of Lands herebydeclare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the land described below are needed for a public purposeand the servitude of the land will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      467.46,
      295.21,
      554.22
    ],
